&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Make &lt;code&gt;DiagnosticTextRenderer&lt;/code&gt; numbers monospace by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/qwertychouskie/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/qwertychouskie"&gt;@qwertychouskie&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4979864141" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21860" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21860/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21860"&gt;#21860&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Release the &lt;code&gt;TextBlock&lt;/code&gt; text layout when the control is detached by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ronnycohen/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ronnycohen"&gt;@ronnycohen&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5549938352" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22281" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22281/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22281"&gt;#22281&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
